{
    "title": "Cute Drawing : Anime Color Fan",
    "description": "Introduce your child to the wonderful world of art with Cute Drawing : Anime Color Fan Games, one of the best drawing apps and coloring books for kids! This top coloring game for kids features over 100 coloring pages with unique anime, cartoons, and manga-style drawings. Designed for use on smartphones and tablets with seamless resolution adaption, it's one of the most kid-friendly anime drawing and coloring games.\r\n\r\n Kids Coloring Game includes beautiful and exquisite picture content:\r\n\u2605Q version avatar (cute two-dimensional Q version character avatar) \r\n\u2605Animals  (learn about various cute little animals while coloring)\r\n\u2605Flower Fairy (Looking for magic in the lovely fairy tale world) \r\n\u2605Ancient style (Q version of ancient style characters, feel the charm of oriental culture) \r\n\u2605Goth sweethearts (cool and sweet girls, and mysterious Halloween elves)\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\u2605 Unique anime art style, fun for all ages!\r\n\u2605 Over 20 abundant color palettes, including gradient, glittery colors, patterned stickers - satisfy all your coloring needs!\r\n\u2605 Layering for 3D effects, looks great no matter how you color! Never hurts confidence, gets kids to love coloring and stimulate imagination!\r\n\u2605Have \u201cUndo\u201d and \u201cClear All\u201d features!\r\n\u2605 Support multiple canvases, doodle on one picture countless times and save them all!\r\n\u2605 Save drawings to album, then share or edit them!\r\n\r\nIn this essential coloring game for kids, explore coloring pages featuring all their favorite characters and themes. With new images and pictures added regularly, kids will never run out of drawing and coloring inspiration. Simple yet challenging pictures improve drawing skills and expand creativity. Let them create their own beautiful, vibrant art collection in this premier coloring book for kids!\r\n\r\nThe easy-to-use drawing tools allow kids to try new ideas and revisit finished art anytime. They can use their imagination to color cute characters, animals, magical scenes and more. Then they share their colorful creations on social media for the world to enjoy!\r\n\r\nWith Cute Drawing : Anime Color Fan Games, kids can access all the anime coloring pages for free. If your kid loves to draw, this top drawing game for kids is a must-have. The anime style makes coloring and drawing anime even more fun. Kids can also learn to draw anime step-by-step with the easy tutorials.\r\n\r\nThis essential coloring game for kids is perfect for budding artists and fans of drawing games for kids, coloring games for kids, anime coloring books, anime drawing tutorials, and other art for kids. Let their creativity run wild!\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy\r\nAt Cute Drawing : Anime Color Fan Games, the well-being of children and families is our top priority. We prioritize privacy and adhere to all relevant regulations. For detailed information on our privacy policy, please visit: https://sites.google.com/view/joycraze-family-privacy",
